            "description": "Declares the keyboard as an inline-autofill capable IME (android:supportsInlineSuggestions in the input method descriptor), so the autofill framework offers password manager fill suggestions to it. The declaration is the whole patch: drawing the fill bubble is done by the companion module, not by the keyboard.",
